# THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md states that the ROHM reference sources under driver/
# and utility/ are the originals with line endings converted from CRLF to LF.
# Without this file that claim depends on each contributor's core.autocrlf
# setting, and re-copying a file from a CRLF source silently reintroduces CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts: no line-ending conversion, no textual diff.
*.a   binary
*.FLM binary
*.bin binary
*.hex binary
